# S2b (plan.md step 10): the node agent's serving sequence on all four cards with the Thatch thin layer. Needs
# serving/tp4-g1 commit 2 (quad replay) in the tag's ancestry; main's parser refuses replay under C2_CARDS=quad.
# NO reset here, on purpose: it runs AFTER the fabric re-measure (step 8), so its first mesh open is the one
# production makes (after test_system_health's teardown), and the QSFP gate's measurement stays newer than every
# /dev/tenstorrent node until the placement.
# Before it: the thin layer must be in the rig daemon under its immutable tag (the tt-serving-image run's verify step
# already pulls it there, the ARC pods sharing the rig's daemon; a report-only publish with
# source=target=zot.thatch.local:5000/thatch-serving-tt:<TS7> pulls it otherwise). This job's status step prints
# "=== fleet tag and platform image": the <TS7> line's registry digest must be the tt-serving-image run's digest.
# The replay source image need NOT be pulled: the tracked record carries its ENV (source step image_env_from=record).
# PUBLIC REPO: name the thin layer by its :TS7 tag (the Thatch.Server short sha the tt-serving-image run printed),
# never a digest.
# C2_REPLAY_PROFILE is EMPTY on purpose: the container boots the image default, which is what production boots;
# commit 2's --expect-profile requires "[QWEN-C2] profile general-prefix-tp4: vLLM argv" and "[QWEN-TP4] ring OK".
# Read: replay/platform-replay.json passed=true, every step ok (source image_env_subtracted=true, start, load,
# served_name, expect_profile, warmup, coding, concurrent, tool_call, traffic, reload, restart), and docker-run.json:
# four --device, MESH_DEVICE=P150x4, the agent's p150x4 descriptor path, THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP=0.
# C1 as in S1 (the parser needs a tag; the replay runs C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE). Duration: status 1-2 min, replay 30-60 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status replay
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=zot.thatch.local:5000/thatch-serving-tt:TS7
C2_REPLAY_PROFILE=
C2_REPLAY_SERVED_MODEL=
